{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review restrictions on non-lethal self-defence tools for women",
        "additional_details": "Aligning with national VAWG strategy goals, this review should assess whether non-lethal deterrents\u2014including defensive sprays and electronic incapacitation devices\u2014can safely expand personal safety options. Evaluate robust legal frameworks: mandatory criminal record checks, individual licensing, accredited defensive training, strict age restrictions, and mandatory secure home storage requirements to prevent misuse while offering regulated, low-harm protection.",
        "background": "Commission an independent review into policies and legal restrictions on non-lethal deterrents\u2014including non-injurious sprays and regulated conducted energy items\u2014to evaluate strict safeguards, licensing, and safety standards to enhance women's personal safety in public spaces.",
